        "type": "callout",
        "kind": "pattern",
        "title": "Pattern: who + eats/drinks + what",
        "body_en": "Put the person first, then chī or hē, then the food. Add bù before the verb to say not: Wǒ bù chī ròu. To say how many, use a number plus gè: sān gè píngguǒ. Order of a sentence: person, verb, thing.",
        "body_py": "Rén zài qián, ránhòu shì chī huò hē, zuìhòu shì shíwù. Zài dòngcí qián jiā bù biǎoshì bù: Wǒ bù chī ròu. Shuō shùliàng yòng shùzì jiā gè: sān gè píngguǒ. Jùzi shùnxù: rén, dòngcí, dōngxi.",
